{
  "name": "CAG Question Sweep",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CAG Question Sweep\n\nAsk many questions against ONE warm document in a single call. The document is read once (already cached); each question only costs its own tokens, so a sweep of hundreds of questions is cheap.\n\n```\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5678/webhook/cag/sweep \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n        \"document_id\": 7,\n        \"questions\": [\n          \"What is the peak current limit?\",\n          \"What is the continuous load limit?\",\n          \"Which section covers thermal shutdown?\"\n        ]\n      }'\n```\n\n`document_id` is optional — omit it to sweep the most recently cached document.\nThe response is an array of `{question, answer, cache_source, error}`.\nOne failing question is captured (error branch) and does not abort the sweep.\n\nNo credentials needed — cag-api does all the work.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-320, -220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "cag/sweep",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Sweep Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [200, 0],
      "webhookId": "6b1c9d2e-4a3f-4b8c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.questions",
        "include": "allOtherFields",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "question"
        }
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Split Questions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://cag-api:8000/query",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ question: $json.question, document_id: $json.body.document_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3600000
        }
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Ask CAG API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [700, 0],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sweep-ok-1",
              "name": "question",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Questions').item.json.question }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-ok-2",
              "name": "answer",
              "value": "={{ $json.answer }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-ok-3",
              "name": "cache_source",
              "value": "={{ $json.timings?.cache_source }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-ok-4",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Collect Answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [960, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "sweep-err-1",
              "name": "question",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Questions').item.json.question }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-err-2",
              "name": "answer",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-err-3",
              "name": "cache_source",
              "value": "={{ null }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "sweep-err-4",
              "name": "error",
              "value": "={{ $json.error?.message ?? $json.error ?? 'CAG API request failed' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Mark Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [960, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateIndividualFields",
        "fieldsToAggregate": {
          "fieldToAggregate": [
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "question"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "answer"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "cache_source"
            },
            {
              "fieldToAggregate": "error"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Aggregate Answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e73f40-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Respond With Results",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1480, 0]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Sweep Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Split Questions",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Split Questions": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask CAG API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ask CAG API": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Collect Answer",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Mark Failure",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Collect Answer": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Aggregate Answers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Mark Failure": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Aggregate Answers",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Aggregate Answers": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond With Results",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "active": false
}
